"Govagn" will replace all 150+ occurrences of "AgentFabric" across the repository. The renaming process will be executed seamlessly to prevent breaking the build pipeline.

### Execution Scope
1. **Documentation Updates**: Search and replace across `README.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, `PILOT_PLAYBOOK.md`, `EXECUTION_PLAN.md`, and all other markdown files.
2. **Frontend Branding (Portal)**: Update the `<title>`, application headers, logos (if applicable), and text in `portal/src/`.
